  "slug": "feta-cheese-ball",
  "name": "Feta Cheese Ball",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "For all you garlic-lovers--this cheese ball is easy and delicious! I get a lot of requests for this recipe. Serve with garlic bagel chips.",
  "cuisine": "Greek",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "In a large bowl, combine cream cheese, feta cheese, olive oil, green onions and garlic. Season with dill, oregano and pepper. Mix well, and form into 2 balls. Cover, and chill for 2 hours."
    }
  ],
  "servings": 32,
